{"id":1163,"root":"كسل","bw":"ksl","tr":"k-s-l","found":true,"html":"<div class=\"lane-entry\">See <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كت</span> and Supplement. </div><div class=\"lane-entry\"> <span class=\"lane-form\">  <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كَسَّلَهُ</span> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">*</span> </span>, inf. n. <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تَكْسِيلٌ</span>, said of satiety, <em>It rendered him heavy, sluggish, lazy, indolent,</em> or <em>torpid.</em> (TA.) </div><div class=\"lane-entry\"> <span class=\"lane-form\">  <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أَكْسَلَ عَنْهَا</span> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">*</span> </span> signifies <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أَولَجَ وَلَمْ يُنْزِلْ</span>; [<em>Inivit sed non emisit;</em>] (IAar, in TA, art. <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فهر</span>;) [i. e., <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أَولَجَ ثُمَّ تَرَكَهَا وَلَمْ يُنْزِلْ</span>]. </div><div class=\"lane-entry\"> <span class=\"lane-form\"> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كَسْلَانٌ</span> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">*</span> </span> <em>Heavy, sluggish, lazy, indolent, torpid.</em> (K.) </div><div class=\"lane-entry\"> <span class=\"lane-form\"> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مَكْسَلَةٌ</span> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">*</span> </span>: see an ex. voce <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كِطَّةٌ</span>. </div>","pages":null,"shownPages":null,"chars":912,"entries":5,"shownEntries":5,"truncated":false,"match":"direct","key":"ksl"}